{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "growth_developer_population",
  "spec": ["growth-developer 5.2", "growth-developer 14.1"],
  "description": "Test 1, the population pass (state 18): d = r24(float(W) x 0.01f) clamped to [0, 1], p = r24(float(capacity) x d), stored as rhe(p) in the int16 grid. Expected values from the Python model (gd/gdmodel.py, numpy float32): 57/1000 -> d 0x3F11EB85, 570; 50/3 -> 2 (1.5 to even); 50/5 -> 2; 33/7 -> d 0x3EA8F5C2, 2; 99/1 -> 1; -20/100 -> 0; 150/40000 -> -25536 (wraps). A city of 8 x 2 tracts: one call (no deadline) does every tract, x inner, z outer, calling UpdatePopulation({dev, x, z, stage 0 [choice]}) on the tract developer fetched once per call. Without a tract developer the map is still written ([choice]); state 17 resets the iterator.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "gdev_env", "cells": [32, 8], "log_population": true},
    {"op": "gdev_create"},
    {"op": "gdev_init", "props": {"0x00000021": {"u32": "0x1010"}, "0x87CD6300": {"u8": 1}, "0x87CD6310": {"u8": 4}, "0x87CD6330": {"u8": 1}, "0x87CD6332": {"u8": 1}}, "expect": true},
    {"op": "gdev_set", "grid": "working", "tracts": [[0, 0, 57], [1, 0, 50], [2, 0, 50], [3, 0, 33], [4, 0, 99], [5, 0, -20], [6, 0, 150]]},
    {"op": "gdev_set", "grid": "capacity", "tracts": [[0, 0, 1000], [1, 0, 3], [2, 0, 5], [3, 0, 7], [4, 0, 1], [5, 0, 100], [6, 0, 40000]]},
    {"op": "gdev_set", "state": {"update_state": 18}},
    {"op": "gdev_clear_events"},
    {"op": "gdev_idle", "ms": 7},
    {"op": "gdev_expect", "state": {"update_state": 19}},
    {"op": "gdev_expect_grid", "grid": "population", "tracts": [[0, 0, 570], [1, 0, 2], [2, 0, 2], [3, 0, 2], [4, 0, 1], [5, 0, 0], [6, 0, -25536], [7, 0, 0], [0, 1, 0], [7, 1, 0]]},
    {"op": "gdev_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "tract_developer"}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "gdev_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "timer_start", "ms": 7}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "gdev_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "update_population"}, "events": [{"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 0, "z": 0, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 1, "z": 0, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 2, "z": 0, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 3, "z": 0, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 4, "z": 0, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 5, "z": 0, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 6, "z": 0, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 7, "z": 0, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 0, "z": 1, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 1, "z": 1, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 2, "z": 1, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 3, "z": 1, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 4, "z": 1, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 5, "z": 1, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 6, "z": 1, "stage": 0}, {"event": "update_population", "tract_developer": "tract_developer", "developer": "dev", "x": 7, "z": 1, "stage": 0}]},
    {"op": "gdev_call", "method": "desirability_fraction", "args": [57], "expect_bits": 1058139013},
    {"op": "gdev_call", "method": "desirability_fraction", "args": [33], "expect_bits": 1051260354},
    {"op": "gdev_call", "method": "desirability_fraction", "args": [150], "expect_bits": 1065353216},
    {"op": "gdev_call", "method": "desirability_fraction", "args": [-20], "expect_bits": 0},
    {"op": "gdev_call", "method": "population_of", "args": [57, 1000], "expect": 570},
    {"op": "gdev_call", "method": "population_of", "args": [50, 3], "expect": 2},
    {"op": "gdev_call", "method": "population_of", "args": [50, 5], "expect": 2},
    {"op": "gdev_call", "method": "population_of", "args": [33, 7], "expect": 2},
    {"op": "gdev_call", "method": "population_of", "args": [99, 1], "expect": 1},
    {"op": "gdev_call", "method": "population_of", "args": [-20, 100], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "gdev_call", "method": "population_of", "args": [150, 40000], "expect": -25536},
    {"op": "gdev_env", "tract_developer": false},
    {"op": "gdev_set", "grid": "population", "fill": 0},
    {"op": "gdev_set", "state": {"update_state": 17}},
    {"op": "gdev_clear_events"},
    {"op": "gdev_idle", "count": 2},
    {"op": "gdev_expect", "state": {"update_state": 19}},
    {"op": "gdev_expect_grid", "grid": "population", "tracts": [[0, 0, 570], [1, 0, 2], [2, 0, 2], [3, 0, 2], [4, 0, 1], [5, 0, 0], [6, 0, -25536]]},
    {"op": "gdev_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "update_population"}, "count": 0}
  ]
}
